"30V maximum input. A 5V, 1.5A regulator drops this input to the +5V used and"
" supplied by the autopilot. Do not connect power to this input if Power "
"Module 2 input is used as they share the BATT2 voltage monitoring circuitry."
" This connector is a JST-EH type."
msgstr ""
"最高输入 30V。内部 5V、1.5A 稳压器将此输入降压至飞控使用和提供的 +5V。如果使用电源模块 2 输入，请勿连接此输入的电源，因为它们共享 "
"BATT2 电压监控电路。此接口为 JST-EH 型。"

