"output to the SBUS input pin next to the Servo/Output VCC input connector. "
"Note that some protocols such as CRSF or FPort including telemetry, require "
"connection to, and setup of, one of the UARTs instead of this pin."
msgstr ""
"所有兼容 RC 协议均可通过将接收机输出连接到舵机/输出 VCC 输入接口旁边的 SBUS 输入引脚来解码。请注意，某些协议（如 CRSF 或包含数传的"
" FPort）需要连接到其中一个 UART 接口并进行设置，而非使用此引脚。"

