#: ../../source/docs/common-qiotek-zealoth7.rst:540
#: f093675a7e29490397cc614c360eaa1d
msgid ""
"There are 2 CAN ports which allow connecting two independant CAN bus "
"outputs. Each of these can have multiple CAN peripheral devices connected. A"
" CAN splitter board is included with the autopilot. Please refer to "
":ref:`CAN Bus Setup <common-canbus-setup-advanced>` for information on how "
"to configure CAN on the board."
msgstr ""
"有 2 个 CAN 接口，可连接两路独立的 CAN 总线输出。每路可连接多个 CAN 外设。飞控随附一个 CAN 分路板。有关在飞控板上配置 CAN "
"的信息，请参见 :ref:`CAN 总线设置 <common-canbus-setup-advanced>`。"

